{"id": "11th_tamil_u5_q195", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_and_pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq_agananuru_numbers_test", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] அகநானூற்றில் 6, 16, 26, 36, 46... என 6-இல் முடியும் எண்களைக் கொண்ட பாடல்கள் எந்தத் திணைக்குரியவை? அப்பாடல்களின் மொத்த எண்ணிக்கை எத்தனை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குறிஞ்சித் திணை; 80 பாடல்கள்", "B": "முல்லைத் திணை; 40 பாடல்கள்", "C": "மருதத் திணை; 40 பாடல்கள்", "D": "நெய்தல் திணை; 40 பாடல்கள்"}, "explanation": "அகநானூற்றில் 6 என முடியும் எண்கள் கொண்ட பாடல்கள் மருதத் திணைக்குரியவை; இவற்றின் மொத்த எண்ணிக்கை 40 பாடல்கள் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] In Agananuru, which Thinai do poems ending in 6 (6, 16, 26...) represent, and what is their total count?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kurinji; 80 poems", "B": "Mullai; 40 poems", "C": "Marutham; 40 poems", "D": "Neythal; 40 poems"}, "explanation": "Poems ending in 6 represent Marutham thinai, totaling 40 poems."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "c